  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>“How d’ya think it works? You take a flashlight, you know that metal stick that ain’t a sex aid, and bolt it on. It ain’t complicated, I promise.”</em></p>\n<p>A barrel-oriented Flashlight with a 1- is installed that can be used without a hand while the weapon is wielded. Runs off easily rechargeable (1 hour) battery packs that last up to 2 hours of continual use. Extra battery packs cost 20eb (Everyday).</p>\n<p>This negates the penalty for firing in darkness, night, or low light conditions at targets the flashlight is illuminating (for you and anyone whom can see the flashlight’s projection), but does not negate the penalty from obscurement by smoke, fog, or a similar effect. When the weapon is not currently being wielded, the light automatically turns off.</p>\n<p><strong>WEAPON MODS</strong></p>\n<p><strong>“V! Your sweet little ‘45 is waitin’ for its mommy! Purrs after every shot now.”</strong></p>\n<p><em>— Robert Wilson</em></p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Miscellaneous &amp; Accessories).</em></p>"
